$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Air";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Place: <f0> Golberg's English Class Room" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Nice" @
         "\n<f1>Type of Day: <f0> School Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other on the verdant school grounds of Goldberg Elementary School.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag to capture before school is let out. The first team with eight captures shall be the victor and pass the final exam! Capture the Eliminator and get a free pass to a collage of your choice." @
         "\n<f2>WARNING:<f2> Do not try to attempt the old fly around the center wall trick without a hall pass or you will find yourself in detention.  The Multipass Remix (that's pronounced 'mool-tee-pas') adds an additional challenge.  Don't get caught in the hall without your Multipass, or it's off to detention." @
         "\n\n<f1>Map idea by:<f0> Goldberg (Mappers Extreme)" @
         "\n<f1>Built and engineered by:<f0> EEPROM (Mappers Extreme)"@
	 "\n<f1>Multipass remix by:<f0> Goldberg (Mappers Extreme)";